+        "O(nm) and at shipping n=128,m=256 uses 65,408 conventional field "
+        "operations (measured wall-clock cost is recorded by selftest), while "
+        "Section 6's L(Hv)+Sv trapdoor route uses at most 300 exact XORs."
+    ),
