codex
Implemented and verified a native Track B generator based on the paper’s \(M=LH+S\) trapdoored-matrix construction ([arXiv paper](https://arxiv.org/abs/2502.13060)).

Key results:

- Shipping preset: \(128\times320\)
- Dense reference: 81,792 field operations
- Trapdoor route: 271 XORs
- Random guesses: 0/200,000
- Five adversarial attacks: each 0/8
- Bare oracle shipping rung: 0/3 solved
- Structural hint: 0/3
- Placebo hint: 0/3
- All mandatory gates pass
- End-to-end artifact emission verified

